menu "CytoScepter microphone audio"

    config MIC_OUTPUT_GAIN_X
        int "Default fixed microphone output gain multiplier"
        range 1 32
        default 16
        help
            Fixed digital gain applied after HPF/FIR/decimation and before the
            shared stereo soft limiter. The same value is applied to both
            microphone channels. A validated HID setting stored in NVS can
            override this default at runtime. This is not AGC.

endmenu
